Why is the attention output required?

Attention allows the model to build context-aware representations.
---------------------------------------------------------

The attention mechanism in a Transformer helps each token build a context-aware representation by incorporating information from other relevant tokens.
For example:
- “The bank approved my loan.”
- “I sat beside the bank of the river.”
The word bank is the same, but its surrounding words differ. Attention helps its representation incorporate the relevant context, helping later Transformer layers process the different meanings.

